  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Students with Visual Impairments through Improved Language Access in Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to have a positive impact on students with visual impairments, enriching their educational experiences, and promoting inclusivity and mutual respect. The collaboration between teachers and students will serve as an example for other schools to emulate and adopt in their educational approaches when it comes to students with visual disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
